OL,5,G0532 Asia Specific
OL,6,     FRobusta coffee is holding up far
OL,7,     Fbetter than arabica as the climate
OL,8,     Fwarms, and no country grows more
OL,9,     Fof it than Vietnam. The question
OL,10,     Fnow is whether Vietnam can
OL,11,     Factually cash in.
OL,12,G0550 Sporting Witness
OL,13,     FJulius Yego became the first
OL,14,     FKenyan to win a World Championship
OL,15,     Fgold medal in a field event.
OL,16,     FNicknamed Mr YouTube Man, Yego
OL,17,     Ftaught himself the javelin by
OL,18,     Fwatching online videos.
